   "en": "Mahou Shoujo × Haiboku Saiban"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "魔法少女×敗北裁判"
   },
   {
    "en": "Magical Girl's Defeat Trial"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In this world, Magical Girls are the only ones who can fight the \"monsters,\" the invaders from another realm. They must be courageous, inspire hope in people, and above all, they must never be defeated! However, some girls crumble under this heavy responsibility and lose to the monsters, tarnishing the name of Magical Girls. In the courtroom of the \"Defeat Trial,\" their disgrace is exposed, and they face severe punishment. To save these unfortunate girls, the rookie magical lawyer, Misago Yuuri, rushes to their aid!",
   "ja": "異界からの侵略者に立ち向かう人類の希望、魔法少女。しかし正義感あふれる少女たちも負ければ一転、「敗北裁判」送りに。その法廷では『敗北』への糾弾と嘲笑、尊厳破壊の恥辱刑が待つのだ…。新人魔法弁護士・岬護ユゥリは、魔法少女『敗北』の謎を解き明かし哀れな少女たちを救うため奔走する！"
  },
